<panel>
  <div name="root" background-color="#000a14" border-radius="12" padding="16" flex-direction="column" gap="6">
    <div font-size="20" color="#00ffff" font-weight="bold" align-self="center">HOW TO PLAY</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#aabbcc">Defend humanoids from alien abduction!</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Landers grab humans from the ground.</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">If a lander escapes - it becomes a Mutant!</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Shoot landers to free grabbed humans.</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Catch falling humans for bonus points.</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Extra life every 10,000 points!</div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#ff0044" padding-top="4">Boss Waves:</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Every 5th wave a BOSS appears!</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Bosses have high HP and drop power-ups.</div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#44ff44" padding-top="4">Power-Ups:</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#ff4444">Rapid Fire - Faster shooting</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#44ff44">Speed Boost - Faster movement</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#4488ff">Shield - Absorbs one hit</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#ffaa00">Triple Shot - Three bullets at once</div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#ffcc33" padding-top="4">Controls:</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Arrows/WASD - Move ship</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Space/F - Shoot</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Shift/E - Smart Bomb</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">H - Hyperspace (emergency teleport)</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Esc/P - Pause</div>
    <div font-size="13" color="#ffcc33" padding-top="4">VR Controls:</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Thumbstick - Move</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Trigger/A - Shoot</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Grip - Smart Bomb</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">Y - Hyperspace</div>
    <div font-size="11" color="#88aacc">B - Pause</div>
    <div name="btn-tutorial-back" background-color="#222233" border-radius="4" padding="8" cursor="pointer" font-size="12" color="#8899aa" align-self="center" margin-top="6">BACK</div>
  </div>
</panel>
